---
/**
 * The Problem section — why most websites underperform.
 * Replaces the old "social media warning" with something more relevant
 * to the new positioning as a solutions provider.
 * Static Astro component.
 */
---

<section class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-gray-950 text-white relative overflow-hidden">
  <div
    class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_20%_0,rgba(6,182,212,0.12),transparent_50%)]"
  >
  </div>

  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-6 lg:px-12 relative z-10">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center">
      <!-- Left: the problem -->
      <div>
        <p
          class="text-sm font-medium tracking-wide text-amber-400 uppercase mb-5"
        >
          The Problem
        </p>

        <h2
          class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-heading font-bold leading-tight mb-6"
        >
          Your website is probably costing you customers right now.
        </h2>

        <p class="text-lg text-white/75 leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-xl">
          Slow pages, poor Google scores, and outdated designs don't just look
          bad — they actively push people away. Every second of load time costs
          you visitors, and Google notices too.
        </p>

        <a
          href="/performance-scanner"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg border border-white/15 bg-white/5 text-white font-heading font-semibold hover:bg-white/10 transition"
        >
          Check your site for free
          <svg
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            width="18"
            height="18"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <path d="M7 17 17 7"></path>
            <path d="M7 7h10v10"></path>
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: concrete stats -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div
          class="rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 p-6 md:p-8"
        >
          <p class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-heading font-black text-kaizen-cyan mb-2">
            53%
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm text-white/60 leading-relaxed">
            of visitors leave if a page takes more than 3 seconds to load
          </p>
        </div>

        <div
          class="rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 p-6 md:p-8"
        >
          <p class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-heading font-black text-kaizen-lime mb-2">
            70%
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm text-white/60 leading-relaxed">
            of small business websites fail Google's quality checks
          </p>
        </div>

        <div
          class="rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 p-6 md:p-8 col-span-2"
        >
          <p class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-heading font-black text-white mb-2">
            Page 2
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm text-white/60 leading-relaxed">
            is where slow sites end up on Google — and nobody scrolls that far
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
